# Test fixture: a librarian with no type, who remembers a lie.
# Every text is a placeholder.

== character fx_librarian
name: Fx Librarian
body: arms_master
voice: male_b
colour: ink

== beat open_after_lie
when: said(lied)
Fx Librarian [dim]: <<You lied to me.>>
> <<Make amends.>> -> amends
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat open
Fx Librarian: <<Yes?>>
> <<Lie about the book.>> -> lie
> <<Leave.>> -> end

== beat lie
do: set(lied), mood(-1)
Fx Librarian [gutter]: <<I do not believe you.>>
-> end

== beat amends
do: clear(lied)
Fx Librarian [calm]: <<Very well.>>
-> end
